      <Entity type="Interface">
        <Name>IInformationSystemService</Name>
        <Access>Public</Access>
        <Location left="2644" top="912" />
        <Size width="295" height="95" />
        <Collapsed>False</Collapsed>
        <Member type="Method">List&lt;ParticipantActivity&gt; GetActivities(Guid courseId, DateTime from, DateTime to)</Member>
        <Member type="Method">List&lt;Course&gt; GetAllCourses()</Member>
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>Design Patterns:
- Command : undo/redo
  (AddCourseCommand, EditCourseCommand,
   DeleteCourseCommand, AddActivityCommand,
   EditActivityCommand, DeleteActivityCommand)
- State   : CourseStatus state machine
  (PopularState, DecliningInterestState,
   RecommendedState, ArchivedState)
- Observer: real-time chart + log file
  (ChartObserver, LogObserver)
- Strategy : XML/JSON persistence
  (XmlDataPersistence, JsonDataPersistence)
+ Repository (architecture): commands and
  the WCF service work over
  ICourseRepository / IActivityRepository

WCF: IInformationSystemService is [ServiceContract].
InformationSystemService maps domain
ParticipantActivity (this diagram) to the
Contracts DTO on transfer.</Text>
        <Location left="509" top="1318" />
        <Size width="265" height="360" />
      </Entity>
