      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>Design Patterns:
- Strategy : 3 interchangeable stat methods
  (MinTopicsAndAvgGradeStrategy,
   AverageEnrollmentsStrategy,
   RecommendedCountStrategy)
- Adapter  : List&lt;ParticipantActivity&gt; →
  Dictionary&lt;string, List&lt;ReducedActivity&gt;&gt;
  (ActivityAdapter)

Note: ReducedActivity keeps only concrete
activity data; key format "CourseID-Date1-Date2".
Status is retained so RecommendedCountStrategy
can count Recommended occurrences.

WCF: IInformationSystemService is [ServiceContract].
ParticipantActivity here is the Contracts DTO
([DataContract], data fields only).</Text>
        <Location left="19" top="240" />
        <Size width="360" height="300" />
      </Entity>
